![RankMode](cover.png)

This is a simple system to store your scores in the game
[Pump it Up](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pump_It_Up_(video_game_series)).

It has a song list and a simple rest API to store the data.

It is a great example of:

- User systems
- Data storage
- Migrations
- Rest API
- Tailwind

```github
ElixirCL/rankmode | Estadísticas de Rankmode para Pump It Up
```
